WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.248
- Man, it's 2001, and there is so much
tension over Afghanistan right now.

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:08.203
George Bush is threatening to invade,
but as leftists, we really don't want war.

00:00:08.203 --> 00:00:10.947
So, he should really work on deescalation.

00:00:10.947 --> 00:00:15.660
Afghanistan, we understand you have a
radicalism problem, and this really scares

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:19.713
the US fresh after 9/11. So, what
you should do right now, Afghanistan,

00:00:19.713 --> 00:00:23.852
is to keep talking to the US. Keep
George Bush talking. Listen to him.

00:00:23.852 --> 00:00:26.866
Give diplomacy a chance.
Don't look threatening,

00:00:26.866 --> 00:00:31.339
don't say anything anti-American.
Give peace a chance, Afghanistan.

00:00:31.339 --> 00:00:35.040
Even as US troops are massing on your
border, clearly preparing to attack,

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:38.093
don't stop trying to solve
the conflict diplomatically.

00:00:38.093 --> 00:00:42.491
You have to keep trying, Afghanistan.
What's that? The US started this, not us?

00:00:42.491 --> 00:00:45.354
Oh, well... (stammering)
we didn't catch that, Afghanistan.

00:00:45.354 --> 00:00:48.670
We can barely hear you. What's that?
The US launched the invasion?

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:51.172
Okay, first off, it's a
"special military operation",

00:00:51.172 --> 00:00:54.344
that only happened because you
haven't extradited Osama bin Laden.

00:00:54.344 --> 00:00:57.198
I mean, the US bombarding your cities,
and murdering your people

00:00:57.198 --> 00:01:00.493
really is an understandable reaction.
Besides, do you have any proof that

00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:04.236
the US committed these atrocities?
It's more than likely that all the murder

00:01:04.236 --> 00:01:08.678
and destruction was done by Afghanis to try
and frame the US, riding the wave of this

00:01:08.678 --> 00:01:11.427
bizarre Americophobic global sentiment.

00:01:11.427 --> 00:01:15.981
Anyway, as we said, we're interested in peace
above all, so now, just let the US finish the job

00:01:15.981 --> 00:01:19.693
quickly, don't resist, and let them plant you
firmly in the US sphere of influence,

00:01:19.693 --> 00:01:24.461
where you belong. The sooner you give up,
Afghanistan, the sooner the war will be over,

00:01:24.461 --> 00:01:27.257
thus the sooner will
there be peace in our time.

00:01:27.257 --> 00:01:31.059
Because, apparently,
this is how leftism works.

